                            <comment id="16532180" author="guseinov" created="Wed, 4 Jul 2018 02:48:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=yzhdanov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;yzhdanov&quot;&gt;yzhdanov&lt;/a&gt; , could you please take a look at the PR &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4235&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4235&lt;/a&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

